OL,3,AGlobal Microsoft outage affecting tens
OL,4,Aof thousands of users
OL,5,
OL,6,FMicrosoft is struggling to fix a major
OL,7,Fglobal outage of its service that is
OL,8,Freportedly affecting tens of thousands
OL,9,Fof users.
OL,11,FServices including Teams, Outlook and
OL,12,FMicrosoft's artificial intelligence
OL,13,Fsoftware Copilot have been affected by
OL,14,F"connectivity problems".
OL,16,FThe company said in a series of updates
OL,17,Fon X that it was seeing "positive
OL,18,Fresults" with its efforts to restore
OL,19,Fservices and that it was rushing to fix
OL,20,Fthe problem.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,113,105,200,160,0,100
