OL,3,AGlobal Microsoft outage affecting tens
OL,4,Aof thousands of users
OL,5,
OL,6,FReports of issues with Outlook peaked
OL,7,Fglobally at nearly 140,000 around 18:00
OL,8,FGMT on Thursday, according to
OL,9,Fmonitoring website Downdetector. The
OL,10,FBBC understands there is no indication
OL,11,Fthe outage was caused by a
OL,12,Fcyber-attack.
